{"3732530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Venusville - Prologue", "steam_appid": 3732530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a robotic floating platform in the hostile clouds of Venus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Venusville: Prologue</strong>, take command of an autonomous corporate mission to construct and stabilize a floating platform high in Venus’s polar atmosphere. With no humans on board, your robotic workforce must establish infrastructure, maintain balance, and power the systems to needed to test the future colony technology.<br> But as the platform approaches the planet’s swirling polar cyclone, strange signals begin to emerge…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robotic City Building</strong>: Direct worker and engineer robots to process resources, builder robots to construct modules, and transport robots to optimize production, powered by charging stations and maintained by repair bays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/89f0ba68a28b14549ff62db62f67e61b.poster.avif?t=1785934164\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/89f0ba68a28b14549ff62db62f67e61b.webm?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/89f0ba68a28b14549ff62db62f67e61b.mp4?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buoyancy and Balance</strong>: Carefully position solar panels, Stirling engines, heavy batteries and vertical engines to keep your platform stable, preventing flips or descents into high-pressure depths.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/ec2a4ffbb6234610ac74051d259a9d8e.poster.avif?t=1785934164\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/ec2a4ffbb6234610ac74051d259a9d8e.webm?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/ec2a4ffbb6234610ac74051d259a9d8e.mp4?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polar Exploration</strong>: Build a scanner station to map the polar region and track down the mysterious anomaly once detected from orbit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Management</strong>: Harness solar energy and Stirling engines (using heat differences from altitude changes) to power robots and establish production chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Resource Extraction: </strong>Mine raw gases from the clouds and refine them into sulphur-based plastics, carbons, chemicals and metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.poster.avif?t=1785934164\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.webm?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.mp4?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manufacture Advanced Materials</strong>: Use the basic resources to expand your city and manufacture materials like graphene, nanotubes, electronics, and diamond-based computer chips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Challenges</strong>: Survive acid clouds, extreme temperatures, and pressure hazards that threaten your platform’s stability and power supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/bb88e8c065c70aa4a1140daa052acd5c.webp?t=1785934164\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/bb88e8c065c70aa4a1140daa052acd5c.poster.webp?t=1785934164\" class=\"bb_img\" width=620 height=185 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Venusville: Prologue</i> is a focused, replayable prequel to the upcoming <i>Venusville</i>, introducing its unique floating-city mechanics in a mysterious and volatile setting. Build, stabilize, and prepare — something is waiting in the clouds.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a robotic floating platform in the hostile clouds of Venus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Venusville: Prologue</strong>, take command of an autonomous corporate mission to construct and stabilize a floating platform high in Venus’s polar atmosphere. With no humans on board, your robotic workforce must establish infrastructure, maintain balance, and power the systems to needed to test the future colony technology.<br> But as the platform approaches the planet’s swirling polar cyclone, strange signals begin to emerge…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robotic City Building</strong>: Direct worker and engineer robots to process resources, builder robots to construct modules, and transport robots to optimize production, powered by charging stations and maintained by repair bays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/89f0ba68a28b14549ff62db62f67e61b.poster.avif?t=1785934164\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/89f0ba68a28b14549ff62db62f67e61b.webm?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/89f0ba68a28b14549ff62db62f67e61b.mp4?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buoyancy and Balance</strong>: Carefully position solar panels, Stirling engines, heavy batteries and vertical engines to keep your platform stable, preventing flips or descents into high-pressure depths.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/ec2a4ffbb6234610ac74051d259a9d8e.poster.avif?t=1785934164\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/ec2a4ffbb6234610ac74051d259a9d8e.webm?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/ec2a4ffbb6234610ac74051d259a9d8e.mp4?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polar Exploration</strong>: Build a scanner station to map the polar region and track down the mysterious anomaly once detected from orbit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Management</strong>: Harness solar energy and Stirling engines (using heat differences from altitude changes) to power robots and establish production chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Resource Extraction: </strong>Mine raw gases from the clouds and refine them into sulphur-based plastics, carbons, chemicals and metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.poster.avif?t=1785934164\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.webm?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.mp4?t=1785934164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manufacture Advanced Materials</strong>: Use the basic resources to expand your city and manufacture materials like graphene, nanotubes, electronics, and diamond-based computer chips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Challenges</strong>: Survive acid clouds, extreme temperatures, and pressure hazards that threaten your platform’s stability and power supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/bb88e8c065c70aa4a1140daa052acd5c.webp?t=1785934164\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/extras/bb88e8c065c70aa4a1140daa052acd5c.poster.webp?t=1785934164\" class=\"bb_img\" width=620 height=185 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Venusville: Prologue</i> is a focused, replayable prequel to the upcoming <i>Venusville</i>, introducing its unique floating-city mechanics in a mysterious and volatile setting. Build, stabilize, and prepare — something is waiting in the clouds.</p>", "short_description": "Guide a robotic mission in Venus’s polar clouds in this space colonisation city builder. Collect energy, mine resources, balance buoyancy to stay afloat, in the treacherous Venusian atmosphere, and build a self-sufficient base while navigating storms and acid clouds to hunt mysterious anomalies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/d8331e3671a2f33b5b842cf01201bc7aacd0199f/header.jpg?t=1785934164", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/6f6e372fafb4586dd1e4eb2ad746f09775ae3fae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785934164", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732530/6f6e372fafb4586dd1e4eb2ad746f09775ae3fae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785934164", "website": "https://orbitstarstudios.co.uk/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 370 or equivalent (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 / GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versio